  "description": "Azam is a senior cryptography researcher at Consensys company. She mainly works on the design and implementation of practical SNARK for layer 2 also known as zk-rollup.\r\n\r\n She has been working as a researcher at Ecole Normal Superieure and Ecole Polytechnique, France, where she has done research on double-preventing signature schemes,  functional encryptions, commitment schemes, and SNARK."
